# The big raw CSV is NOT committed (see README for the download command).
data/raw/*.csv

# NOTE: static/data/ (the generated JSON) IS committed, so the live site has
# data without a build-time ETL step. It's ~8 MB for the sample. If you switch
# to the full dataset, host that JSON externally (e.g. Cloudflare R2) instead.
